Here is the root cause:
The root cause of the bug is that the original implementation in `DocBuilder.java` was designed to handle only a single field per column name, which led to issues when multiple fields were associated with the same column name. This limitation resulted in incorrect behavior when attempting to process such fields, as only one field would be retrieved and processed, thereby ignoring any additional fields mapped to the same column.

